      "id": "sol.ahsme-1978-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "With \\(u=\\frac{2}{x},\\) the equation becomes \\(1-2u+u^2=0,\\) or \\((u-1)^2=0.\\) Therefore \\(\\frac{2}{x}=u=1.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B.",
